								주소 <span class="text-red-500">*</span>
							</label>
							<p class="text-[11px] text-stone-400 tracking-[-0.14px] mb-1.5">상세주소까지 반드시 기재해야 합니다</p>
							<div class="flex gap-2 mb-2">
								<input
									type="text" id="postcode" name="postcode" readonly
									class="w-28 h-10 px-3 text-[15px] text-stone-900 bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200 rounded-xl focus:outline-none placeholder:text-stone-400 tracking-[-0.14px]"
									placeholder="우편번호"
								/>
								<button
									type="button" id="search-address"
									class="h-10 px-4 text-[13px] font-medium text-white bg-[#222222] rounded-xl hover:bg-[#333333] transition-colors tracking-[-0.14px] shrink-0"
								>
									주소 검색
								</button>
							</div>
							<input
								type="text" id="address" name="address" readonly required
								class="w-full h-10 px-3 mb-2 text-[15px] text-stone-900 bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200 rounded-xl focus:outline-none placeholder:text-stone-400 tracking-[-0.14px]"
								placeholder="주소 검색 버튼을 눌러주세요"
							/>
							<input
								type="text" id="address_detail" name="address_detail"
								class="w-full h-10 px-3 text-[15px] text-stone-900 bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-stone-300 placeholder:text-stone-400 tracking-[-0.14px]"
								placeholder="상세주소를 입력해 주세요 (예: 4층 401호)"
							/>
							<div id="postcode-layer" class="hidden relative w-full mt-2 border border-stone-300 rounded-xl overflow-hidden" style="height:400px;">
								<button type="button" id="close-postcode" class="absolute top-2 right-2 z-10 text-[12px] text-stone-500 hover:text-stone-800 bg-white/90 rounded-lg px-2 py-1">닫기</button>
							</div>
							<p class="field-error hidden mt-1 text-[12px] text-red-500" id="address-error"></p>
						</div>

						<!-- 전화번호 (자택) + 전화번호 (휴대폰) -->
						<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
							<div>
								<label for="phone_home" class="block text-[14px] font-medium text-stone-700 tracking-[-0.14px] mb-1.5">
									전화번호 (자택)
								</label>
								<input
									type="text" id="phone_home" name="phone_home" autocomplete="one-time-code"
									class="w-full h-10 px-3 text-[15px] text-stone-900 bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-stone-300 placeholder:text-stone-400 tracking-[-0.14px]"
									placeholder="02-0000-0000"
								/>
								<p class="field-error hidden mt-1 text-[12px] text-red-500"></p>
							</div>
							<div>
								<label for="phone_mobile" class="block text-[14px] font-medium text-stone-700 tracking-[-0.14px] mb-1.5">
									전화번호 (휴대폰) <span class="text-red-500">*</span>
								</label>
								<input
									type="tel" id="phone_mobile" name="phone_mobile" required autocomplete="tel"
									class="w-full h-10 px-3 text-[15px] text-stone-900 bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-stone-300 placeholder:text-stone-400 tracking-[-0.14px]"
									placeholder="010-0000-0000"
								/>
								<p class="field-error hidden mt-1 text-[12px] text-red-500"></p>
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- 서명 -->
						<div>
							<label class="block text-[14px] font-medium text-stone-700 tracking-[-0.14px] mb-1.5">
								서명 <span class="text-red-500">*</span>
							</label>
							<p class="text-[11px] text-stone-400 tracking-[-0.14px] mb-2">본인의 성명을 제3자가 알아볼 수 있도록 기재해 주세요.</p>
							<div class="relative">
								<canvas
									id="signature-canvas"
									class="w-full h-[160px] bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-xl cursor-crosshair touch-none"
								></canvas>
								<button
									type="button"
									id="clear-signature"
									class="absolute top-2 right-2 text-[12px] text-stone-400 hover:text-stone-600 transition-colors bg-white/80 rounded-lg px-2 py-1"
								>
									지우기
								</button>
							</div>
							<p class="field-error hidden mt-1 text-[12px] text-red-500" id="signature-error"></p>
						</div>

						<!-- 동의 날짜 -->
						<div>
							<label class="block text-[14px] font-medium text-stone-700 tracking-[-0.14px] mb-1.5">
								동의 날짜
							</label>
							<p id="agreed-date" class="text-[15px] text-stone-600 tracking-[-0.14px]"></p>
						</div>

						<!-- 개인정보 동의 -->
						<div class="flex items-start gap-3 pt-2">
							<input
								type="checkbox" id="privacy_agreed" name="privacy_agreed" required
								class="mt-0.5 size-4 rounded border-stone-300 accent-[#222222] shrink-0"
							/>
							<label for="privacy_agreed" class="text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-5 tracking-[-0.14px]">
								<span class="text-red-500">*</span>
								본인은 에이아이당(가칭) 창당준비위원회 발기인에 동의하며, 개인정보 수집 및 이용에 동의합니다.
								성명, 주소, 생년월일, 성별, 직업, 전화번호, 서명 정보를 창당 발기인 등록 목적으로 수집하며,
								창당 절차 완료 후 관련 법령에 따라 보관 또는 파기합니다.
							</label>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- 접수하기 버튼 -->
					<div class="mt-8">
						<button
							type="submit"
							id="submit-btn"
							class="inline-flex items-center justify-center h-10 px-6 text-sm font-medium text-white bg-[#222222] rounded-full hover:bg-[#333333] transition-colors tracking-[-0.14px] disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed"
						>
							접수하기
						</button>
					</div>
				</form>

				<!-- 성공 메시지 -->
				<div id="success-message" class="hidden mt-8 bg-stone-100 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center">
					<p class="text-[22px] font-semibold text-stone-800 tracking-[-0.32px] mb-2">
						접수가 완료되었습니다
					</p>
					<p class="text-[15px] text-stone-500 leading-6 tracking-[-0.16px]">
						창당발기인으로 등록해 주셔서 감사합니다.<br/>
						추후 연락드리겠습니다.
					</p>
				</div>

				<!-- 에러 메시지 -->
				<div id="error-message" class="hidden mt-4 p-4 bg-red-50 rounded-xl text-[14px] text-red-600 leading-5"></div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<footer class="mt-40 max-w-6xl w-full mx-auto px-6 pb-24 flex flex-col items-center">
			<p class="text-xs text-stone-400">&copy; 2026 AIP · AI Party</p>
		</footer>
		</main>

		<script>
			const tocIds = ['system','function','platform','product','vision','axis','kpi','os','ux','milestone','join','founding-members'];
			const tocLinks = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.toc-link'));
			function setActiveToc(id) {
				tocLinks.forEach(l => l.classList.toggle('active', l.getAttribute('href') === '#' + id));
			}
			function onTocScroll() {
				let current = tocIds[0];
				for (const id of tocIds) {
					const el = document.getElementById(id);
					if (el && el.getBoundingClientRect().top <= 100) current = id;
				}
				setActiveToc(current);
			}
			window.addEventListener('scroll', onTocScroll, { passive: true });
			window.addEventListener('resize', onTocScroll);
			onTocScroll();

			const tocToggle = document.getElementById('toc-toggle');
			const tocOverlay = document.getElementById('toc-overlay');
			if (tocToggle && tocOverlay) {
				tocToggle.addEventListener('click', () => tocOverlay.classList.toggle('hidden'));
				tocOverlay.querySelectorAll('a').forEach(a => a.addEventListener('click', () => tocOverlay.classList.add('hidden')));
			}
		</script>

		<script type="module">
			import { createClient } from 'https://esm.sh/@supabase/supabase-js@2';
			import SignaturePad from 'https://esm.sh/signature_pad@5';

			const SUPABASE_URL = 'https://bsiatqjivenmblkcujjw.supabase.co';
			const SUPABASE_ANON_KEY = 'eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJzdXBhYmFzZSIsInJlZiI6ImJzaWF0cWppdmVubWJsa2N1amp3Iiwicm9sZSI6ImFub24iLCJpYXQiOjE3NzI3ODk2OTMsImV4cCI6MjA4ODM2NTY5M30.ReRm1mteN7bsWiRoMhHc8EfhLncJuLZ_8hSR-El8-S4';
			const supabase = createClient(SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_ANON_KEY);

			// Signature pad setup
			const canvas = document.getElementById('signature-canvas');
			const ratio = Math.max(window.devicePixelRatio || 1, 1);
			const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();
			canvas.width = rect.width * ratio;
			canvas.height = rect.height * ratio;
			canvas.getContext('2d').scale(ratio, ratio);

			const signaturePad = new SignaturePad(canvas, {
				backgroundColor: 'rgb(255, 255, 255)',
				penColor: 'rgb(0, 0, 0)',
			});

			document.getElementById('clear-signature').addEventListener('click', () => {
				signaturePad.clear();
			});

			// 자택 전화번호 크롬 자동완성 방지
			const phoneHome = document.getElementById('phone_home');
			const clearAutofill = () => {
				if (phoneHome.value && !phoneHome.dataset.userTyped) {
					phoneHome.value = '';
				}
			};
			document.querySelectorAll('input').forEach(input => {
				input.addEventListener('focus', () => setTimeout(clearAutofill, 20));
			});
			phoneHome.addEventListener('animationstart', clearAutofill);
			phoneHome.addEventListener('keydown', () => { phoneHome.dataset.userTyped = '1'; });

			// 다음 주소 검색 API
			const postcodeLayer = document.getElementById('postcode-layer');

			document.getElementById('search-address').addEventListener('click', () => {
				postcodeLayer.classList.remove('hidden');
				new daum.Postcode({
					oncomplete(data) {
						document.getElementById('postcode').value = data.zonecode;
						document.getElementById('address').value = data.roadAddress || data.jibunAddress;
						postcodeLayer.classList.add('hidden');
						document.getElementById('address_detail').focus();
					},
					width: '100%',
					height: '100%',
				}).embed(postcodeLayer);
				postcodeLayer.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });
			});

			document.getElementById('close-postcode').addEventListener('click', () => {
				postcodeLayer.classList.add('hidden');
			});

			// 생년월일 자동 하이픈 입력
			document.getElementById('birth_date').addEventListener('input', (e) => {
				let v = e.target.value.replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');
				if (v.length > 8) v = v.slice(0, 8);
				if (v.length >= 6) {
					v = v.slice(0, 4) + '-' + v.slice(4, 6) + '-' + v.slice(6);
				} else if (v.length >= 4) {
					v = v.slice(0, 4) + '-' + v.slice(4);
				}
				e.target.value = v;
			});

			// 휴대폰 번호 자동 포맷
			function formatMobile(raw) {
				let v = raw.replace(/[^0-9+]/g, '');
				if (v.startsWith('+82')) v = '0' + v.slice(3);
				else if (v.startsWith('82')) v = '0' + v.slice(2);
				v = v.replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');
				if (v.length > 11) v = v.slice(0, 11);
				if (v.length >= 8) {
					return v.slice(0, 3) + '-' + v.slice(3, v.length - 4) + '-' + v.slice(v.length - 4);
				} else if (v.length >= 4) {
					return v.slice(0, 3) + '-' + v.slice(3);
				}
				return v;
			}

			document.getElementById('phone_mobile').addEventListener('input', (e) => {
				e.target.value = formatMobile(e.target.value);
			});

			// Set today's date
			const today = new Date();
			const yyyy = today.getFullYear();
			const mm = String(today.getMonth() + 1).padStart(2, '0');
			const dd = String(today.getDate()).padStart(2, '0');
			document.getElementById('agreed-date').textContent = `${yyyy}년 ${mm}월 ${dd}일`;

			// Validation
			function validateForm(form) {
				const errors = [];
				const fd = new FormData(form);

				const name = fd.get('name')?.trim();
				if (!name || name.length < 2) {
					errors.push({ field: 'name', message: '이름을 2자 이상 입력해 주세요.' });
				}

				const birthRaw = fd.get('birth_date')?.trim();
				if (!birthRaw || !/^\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2}$/.test(birthRaw)) {
					errors.push({ field: 'birth_date', message: '생년월일을 YYYY-MM-DD 형식으로 입력해 주세요.' });
				} else {
					const birth = new Date(birthRaw);
					if (isNaN(birth.getTime())) {
						errors.push({ field: 'birth_date', message: '올바른 날짜를 입력해 주세요.' });
					} else {
						const ageDiff = today.getFullYear() - birth.getFullYear();
						const monthDiff = today.getMonth() - birth.getMonth();
						const age = monthDiff < 0 || (monthDiff === 0 && today.getDate() < birth.getDate()) ? ageDiff - 1 : ageDiff;
						if (age < 18) {
							errors.push({ field: 'birth_date', message: '만 18세 이상만 참여할 수 있습니다.' });
						}
					}
				}

				const gender = fd.get('gender');
				if (!gender) {
					errors.push({ field: 'gender', message: '성별을 선택해 주세요.', isGroup: true });
				}

				const occupation = fd.get('occupation')?.trim();
				if (!occupation) {
					errors.push({ field: 'occupation', message: '직업을 입력해 주세요.' });
				}

				const address = fd.get('address')?.trim();
				if (!address || address.length < 5) {
					errors.push({ field: 'address', message: '주소 검색 버튼을 눌러 주소를 입력해 주세요.', isAddress: true });
				}

				const phoneMobile = fd.get('phone_mobile')?.trim();
				const cleanPhone = phoneMobile?.replace(/[-\s]/g, '');
				if (!cleanPhone || !/^01[016789]\d{7,8}$/.test(cleanPhone)) {
					errors.push({ field: 'phone_mobile', message: '올바른 휴대폰 번호를 입력해 주세요.' });
				}

				if (signaturePad.isEmpty()) {
					errors.push({ field: 'signature', message: '서명을 해 주세요.', isSignature: true });
				}

				const privacyAgreed = form.querySelector('#privacy_agreed').checked;
				if (!privacyAgreed) {
					errors.push({ field: 'privacy_agreed', message: '동의에 체크해 주세요.' });
				}

				return errors;
			}

			function showFieldErrors(errors) {
				errors.forEach(({ field, message, isGroup, isSignature, isAddress }) => {
					if (isSignature) {
						const el = document.getElementById('signature-error');
						el.textContent = message;
						el.classList.remove('hidden');
						return;
					}
					if (isGroup) {
						const el = document.getElementById('gender-error');
						el.textContent = message;
						el.classList.remove('hidden');
						return;
					}
					if (isAddress) {
						const el = document.getElementById('address-error');
						el.textContent = message;
						el.classList.remove('hidden');
						return;
					}
					const input = document.getElementById(field);
					if (input) {
						const errorEl = input.closest('div').querySelector('.field-error');
						if (errorEl) {
							errorEl.textContent = message;
							errorEl.classList.remove('hidden');
						}
						input.classList.add('border-red-400');
						input.addEventListener('input', () => {
							input.classList.remove('border-red-400');
							if (errorEl) errorEl.classList.add('hidden');
						}, { once: true });
					}
				});

				const firstField = errors[0];
				if (firstField.isSignature) {
					document.getElementById('signature-canvas').scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });
				} else if (firstField.isGroup) {
					document.getElementById('gender-group').scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });
				} else if (firstField.isAddress) {
					document.getElementById('address').scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });
				} else {
					const el = document.getElementById(firstField.field);
					if (el) {
						el.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });
						el.focus();
					}
				}
			}

			// Form submission
			const form = document.getElementById('founding-member-form');
			const submitBtn = document.getElementById('submit-btn');
			const successDiv = document.getElementById('success-message');
			const errorDiv = document.getElementById('error-message');

			form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
				e.preventDefault();

				errorDiv.classList.add('hidden');
				document.querySelectorAll('.field-error').forEach(el => {
					el.textContent = '';
					el.classList.add('hidden');
				});
				document.querySelectorAll('.border-red-400').forEach(el => {
					el.classList.remove('border-red-400');
				});

				const errors = validateForm(form);
				if (errors.length > 0) {
					showFieldErrors(errors);
					return;
				}

				submitBtn.disabled = true;
				submitBtn.textContent = '접수 중...';

				try {
					const fd = new FormData(form);
					const signatureData = signaturePad.toDataURL('image/png');

					const fullAddress = [fd.get('address').trim(), fd.get('address_detail')?.trim()].filter(Boolean).join(' ');

					const { error } = await supabase.from('founding_members').insert({
						name: fd.get('name').trim(),
						address: fullAddress,
						birth_date: fd.get('birth_date'),
						gender: fd.get('gender'),
						occupation: fd.get('occupation').trim(),
						phone_home: fd.get('phone_home')?.trim() || null,
						phone_mobile: fd.get('phone_mobile').trim(),
						signature_data: signatureData,
						agreed_at: `${yyyy}-${mm}-${dd}`,
						privacy_agreed: true,
					});

					if (error) throw error;

					form.classList.add('hidden');
					successDiv.classList.remove('hidden');
					successDiv.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });

				} catch (err) {
					console.error('Submission error:', err);
					errorDiv.textContent = '접수 중 오류가 발생했습니다. 잠시 후 다시 시도해 주세요.';
					errorDiv.classList.remove('hidden');
					submitBtn.disabled = false;
					submitBtn.textContent = '접수하기';
				}
			});
		</script>
	</body>
</html>
